# Belt-and-suspenders on top of .gitignore: `vercel deploy` uploads the
# local working directory, and its respect for .gitignore has proven
# unreliable in practice (a build log surfaced "Detected .env file"
# after a deploy, meaning it was uploaded despite .gitignore excluding
# it from git). Real secrets (DB password, SESSION_SECRET) live in
# these files — never let them into a deployment bundle.
.env
.env.local
.env*.local
prisma/*.db
prisma/*.db-journal
